        <mxCell id="scope-note" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:14px;line-height:1.35;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Register — source-scoped class view&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;GET /register · POST /register&lt;br&gt;GET /register/otp · POST /register/otp · POST /register/otp/resend&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Only flow-relevant members are shown. Constructors, Lombok/record accessors and unrelated operations are omitted. Underline = static; italic classifier = abstract; {readOnly} = final reference.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;size=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2900" y="65" width="1360" height="155" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="state-note" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:14px;line-height:1.35;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;OTP state&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PendingRegistration is a private static nested type, created/read by the verification service and stored through HttpSession under REGISTER_STATE. It is not a field of the service.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;15-minute lifetime · 5-minute email cooldown · 5 failed attempts.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;size=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="800" y="1980" width="760" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="persistence-note" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:14px;line-height:1.35;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Persistence contract&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;createCandidateWithPasswordHash() is @Transactional. It selects role &quot;Candidate&quot;, rechecks identifiers, saves User via inherited saveAndFlush(), then Candidate via inherited save().&lt;br&gt;User.accountStatus = &quot;Active&quot;; department = null.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;JpaSpecificationExecutor is outside this registration view. Generic entity bindings are shown on repository inheritance arrows.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;size=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2900" y="2210" width="1360" height="225" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="validation-note" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:14px;line-height:1.35;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Validation and view boundary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;@Valid invokes Bean Validation; @PasswordMatches delegates to PasswordMatchesValidator.&lt;br&gt;RegisterAccountRequest: @NotBlank, @Size, @Email.&lt;br&gt;OTP request: @NotBlank, @Pattern(&quot;[0-9]{6}&quot;).&lt;br&gt;Thymeleaf templates / JavaScript are view resources, not Java classifiers.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;size=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="50" y="1110" width="800" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
